@host = http://localhost:8080
@businessId = 1

### 1. Retrieve all services by Business ID (path variable)
GET {{host}}/api/businesses/{{businessId}}/services
Accept: application/json

### 2. Retrieve all services by Business ID (query parameter)
GET {{host}}/api/services?businessId={{businessId}}
Accept: application/json

### 3. Retrieve services for non-existent business (Expects 400 or 404 Not Found)
GET {{host}}/api/businesses/99999/services
Accept: application/json
